# T45 — Larger real contract-alignment fix corpus + parent-state excerpt package (Codex, offline mining + build)

**Supervisor authorization (delegated to Claude):** this task overrides the general instruction in `research/AGENTS.md` / `09_collab/PROTOCOL.md` to read `COLLAB_BOARD.md`. Do **not** read the board. Append your one Log line to it with a shell append (`>>`) only. Read `09_collab/PROTOCOL.md`, then this file.

Effort: xhigh.

## Do not read
Do not open, list or search any of these:
- `RESEARCH_STATE.md`
- `08_experiments/E1_pilot/pilot_results/PILOT_SUMMARY.md`
- `08_experiments/E6_realfix/E6_RESULTS.md`, `08_experiments/E6_realfix/e6_scores.csv`
- anything under `08_experiments/E7_repairdir/`
- `09_collab/reports/DAY_*`, `09_collab/reports/MORNING_*`
- any `labels_*`, `report_*`, `review_*` or `search_*` in `08_experiments/E2_labelling/`
- other blind packages or keys, except `08_experiments/E6_realfix/combined_accepted.csv`, which you need (step 5).

## Goal
Build a larger corpus of **real contract-alignment fixes** with known developer fix direction, using the **same acceptance protocol as T42/T43**. Then build a **parent-state-only excerpt package** for a later blind reading task. You do not label or classify anything beyond what T42/T43 recorded.

## Inputs (read-only, untrusted)
**Bare clones** in `/run/media/afridi/Shared Data/api_research_upstream/`:
- **12 new repos** (Claude cloned them; if any is missing, report it and continue):
  - sldt-digital-twin-registry, basyx-java-server-sdk, FAAAST-Service, kapua, apicurio-registry, nessie, polaris, ditto;
  - kratos, hydra, harbor, gravitee-api-management.
- **The 22 earlier repos (T42/T43).** Here, only candidates you did not already review: everything that has no `review_status` of accepted/rejected/deferred in `08_experiments/E6_realfix/candidates.csv` or `t43/candidates.csv`.

**Languages are mixed:** Java/Kotlin and Go (plus whatever the earlier repos contain).
- Contract surfaces:
  - checked-in OpenAPI/Swagger files, including multi-file specs referenced via `$ref`, under any path;
  - JVM contract annotations, as in T42.
- Behaviour surfaces: handlers, controllers, resources, routes, DTOs and models, validators, serializers, exception and error mapping, in any of these languages.

**Repo metadata** (from Claude, GitHub API, 2026-11-15; stars / created / last push):

| Repo | Stars | Created | Last push |
|---|---|---|---|
| sldt-digital-twin-registry | 19 | 2022-04 | 2026-09 |
| basyx-java-server-sdk | 84 | 2023-03 | 2026-11 |
| FAAAST-Service | 94 | 2022-01 | 2026-11 |
| kapua | 247 | 2016-10 | 2026-11 |
| apicurio-registry | 957 | 2019-07 | 2026-11 |
| nessie | 1531 | 2020-04 | 2026-11 |
| polaris | 2119 | 2024-05 | 2026-11 |
| ditto | 952 | 2017-04 | 2026-11 |
| kratos | 13960 | 2018-05 | 2026-07 |
| hydra | 17667 | 2015-05 | 2026-07 |
